Origin: vendor, Peios; CPython 3.14.7 release source
Forwarded: not-needed; Peios authority-service and package-worker integration
Upstream-Source: https://www.python.org/ftp/python/3.14.7/Python-3.14.7.tar.xz
Upstream-SHA256: 3b48dac8fb59f62eaa67ac83c1eb12bda1b7a08406dd286e252c11a66be27f81

Use numeric loopback for transport fixtures while retaining distinct TLS peer
identities. Assertions that require actual hostname/account authority records
check those precise prerequisites; all other tests remain enabled. No runtime
resolver or account implementation is replaced or mocked.

